farmland-atlas/washington/skamania-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids July to August came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, June to July landed at 18% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value, and May to June at 44% that same year. Grid 30934 saw its driest year in 1976, at 61% of normal.</p>"}
